            <h2>How we run Google Ads for jewelry brands in Mumbai</h2>
            <p>Our Google Ads approach for jewelry brands starts with attribution. Before we touch spend, we rebuild tracking so platform-reported ROAS stops lying - CRM + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + offline conversion imports where relevant. Then we build the channel architecture: Meta (Instagram + Facebook), Google Shopping + Performance Max, Instagram organic + Reels, WhatsApp Click-to-WhatsApp as primary, with Pinterest for ring + bridal inspiration, YouTube for try-on + styling content, Google Business Profile for store footfalls layered in as the account matures. Creative strategy is the next lever. For jewelry brands the angles that consistently work are: Dhanteras + Akshaya Tritiya calendar, Wedding + engagement season, BIS + HUID certification trust, AR try-on + video consultation. We ship 20-30 creative units a month in the first 6 months because creative velocity is the single biggest CPL lever early in an engagement.</p>

            <h3>Channels we prioritise</h3>
            <div class="pm-channel-grid">
                <div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">01</span><div><strong>Meta (Instagram + Facebook)</strong><p>Discovery, retargeting, Click-to-WhatsApp, Advantage+ Shopping, Lookalike audiences.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">02</span><div><strong>Google Shopping + Performance Max</strong><p>Buy-intent capture, feed-driven discovery, Performance Max for cross-channel reach.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">03</span><div><strong>Instagram organic + Reels</strong><p>Trust-build + brand velocity + creator UGC + ad-ready content.</p></div></div><div class="pm-channel-item"><span class="pm-channel-num">04</span><div><strong>WhatsApp Click-to-WhatsApp</strong><p>Conversation-first conversion channel for high-AOV + consultative buys.</p></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pm-chips-secondary">
                <span style="font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-right:8px;">Secondary channels:</span>
                <span class="pm-chip-secondary">Pinterest for ring + bridal inspiration</span><span class="pm-chip-secondary">YouTube for try-on + styling content</span><span class="pm-chip-secondary">Google Business Profile for store footfalls</span>
            </div>

            <h3>KPIs we track from day one</h3>
